          "text": "Loud and clear!",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 1.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_2",
          "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
          "text": "Yep, I'm good.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 1.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "goal": "The problem we are solving",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_3",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Alright, let's jump in. We've got a bit of a challenge with Mario Kart's new user growth.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_4",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "It's down 10% from last month, which isn't ideal.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 3.5,
          "context_point_id": "growth_down_10_percent",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_5",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "Yeah, that's what we're looking to turn around.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 3.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_6",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Exactly. To tackle this, we're launching a limited-time event.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_7",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "It's called 'Mario Kart Shell Showdown'.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 2.5,
          "context_point_id": "shell_showdown_event",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_8",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "Oh, the blue shell only one? That's gonna be chaos!",
          "delivery_hint": "playful, a little laugh",
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": "blue_shell_only",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_9",
          "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
          "text": "Sounds fun, actually.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 2.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "goal": "Goals + what success looks like",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_10",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Chaos we can market! Leo, can you walk us through the goals for this?",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_11",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "Sure thing. We're aiming for a 15% increase in new user growth.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": "new_user_growth_15_percent",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_12",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "And we also want to boost our daily active users by 10%.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": "dau_10_percent",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_13",
          "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
          "text": "Those are solid targets.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 2.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_14",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "The main challenge is building a breakthrough multi-channel campaign.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": "multi_channel_campaign",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_15",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "It needs to drive awareness, engagement, and measurable results.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_16",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "And keep that Mario Kart feel, right? Brand consistency is key.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "approach",
      "goal": "Discussion: how we\u2019ll fix it",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_17",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Spot on, Diego. So, how are we thinking about approaching this?",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_18",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "I think we really lean into the 'multi-channel' part. We need to hit everywhere.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": "multi_channel_campaign",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_19",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "And definitely keep those measurable results in mind from the start.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_20",
          "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
          "text": "We should also ensure all our messaging feels consistent with the brand.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_21",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "Yeah, that's crucial. We can't stray too far.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 3.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_22",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "Right. We'll build out the campaign from there, always checking against those goals.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 5.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deliverables_done",
      "goal": "Deliverables + definition of done",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_23",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Okay, let's talk about what we'll actually be producing. Deliverables.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_24",
          "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
          "text": "First, we'll need that Marketing Campaign Report, I think?",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": "marketing_campaign_report",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_25",
          "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
          "text": "Definitely. And a strategy presentation outlining everything.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": "strategy_presentation",
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_26",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
          "text": "So, those two main outputs, then. Got it.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 3.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_27",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Exactly. Those are our key outputs for this.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 3.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wrap",
      "goal": "Next steps + recap",
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_28",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "Alright team, that covers the kickoff. Let's get this into a formal brief.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.5,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_29",
          "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
          "text": "We'll circle back soon to review initial concepts.",
          "delivery_hint": null,
          "est_sec": 4.0,
          "context_point_id": null,
          "training_point_id": null
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_30",
          "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
